  "body": "Experience the pinnacle of freehold & freestanding living with Water Views and School Zones in a quiet cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nNestled in a highly sought-after cul-de-sac, this brand-new residence is a masterpiece of modern design and functional luxury. With captivating sea views serving as an inspiring backdrop, this home offers an effortless lifestyle where every detail has been curated for those with a discerning eye.\r\n\r\nA Commitment to Premium Materiality\r\n\r\nTrue quality is defined by the components that form the home. The exterior features a sophisticated combination of Midland Euro brick and BGC Fibre Cement, ensuring both architectural impact and enduring durability. Inside, the residence stands as a testament to quality:\r\n\r\n* Culinary Excellence: A stylish, state-of-the-art kitchen featuring the reliability of Bosch Series 4 appliances, including a built-in microwave, integrated fridge-freezer, and an efficient Waste Master.\r\n\r\n* Designer Finishes: The bathrooms are elevated by premium Zucchetti tapware and exquisite Robertson Bathware fittings, creating a spa-like retreat in your own home.\r\n\r\n* Tactile Sophistication: Beautiful engineered flooring flows seamlessly across the ground floor, providing a warm, durable, and contemporary foundation. Storage is expertly handled with high-quality wardrobe systems by IKEA that Impress, maximizing space and organization.\r\n\r\n* Peace of Mind: This is a build designed to last, backed by a comprehensive Stanford 10-year warranty and a dedicated one-year maintenance warranty.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Ease\r\n\r\nThe layout is as practical as it is elegant. Spread across two levels, the home features three spacious bedrooms and two-and-a-half well-appointed bathrooms, perfectly catering to contemporary family life. The open-plan living area connects effortlessly to private outdoor spaces, while the secure, single internal-access garage adds to the ease of daily living.\r\n\r\nA Tightly Held Glendowie Address:\r\n\r\nBeyond the architectural brilliance of the home lies a location of undeniable prestige. Perfectly positioned within the highly sought-after zones for Glendowie Primary School and Glendowie College, this property offers the ultimate foundation for your family's future. Surrounded by local beaches, parks, and amenities, this is a rare opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of the area's most desirable, quiet, and safe enclaves.\r\n\r\nFreestanding freedom. Quality finishes. An exceptional Glendowie lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange your private viewing - 022 0506 071",
